<title>ZAIRE: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZAIRE GOVERNMENT LIST (970518)</p>
<p> ************************************************************</p>
<p> * 17 May 97 - Rebel leader Laurent Kabila said he has	*</p>
<p> *		 taken power as head of state and would set   *</p>
<p> *		 up a transitional government within 72 hours.*</p>
<p> *		 He also declared the country the Democratic  *</p>
<p> *		 Republic of the Congo. Former president	*</p>
<p> *		 Mobuto left the country and arrived in	 *</p>
<p> *		 Morocco late in the day.			   *</p>
<p> ************************************************************</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> Head of State (From 17 May 97).................Laurent KABILA</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> Outgoing President...............(Marshal) MOBUTU Sese Seko**</p>
<p>							  (**SEE NOTE ABOVE)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>OUTGOING NATIONAL SALVATION GOVERNMENT (Formed 11 April 97)</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Apptd 9 Apr 97).......General LIKULIA Bolongo</p>
